00:00:32.649 --> 00:00:36.489
Yeah, it was, um, it was not a great year.

00:00:36.489 --> 00:00:43.300
2015 I went out for a motorcycle ride on Memorial
Day weekend and I didn't make it three blocks

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:50.809
from home before a van, a side, sorry, before
a van t-boned me and crushed my foot between

